# iroha's own memory, which is dogfooding output rather than shared memory: this
# repository has no second maintainer to share it with, so committing it would
# add churn to every approval and publish notes written for an audience of one.
# ADR-006 is unchanged — a git-tracked `.iroha/` is still the shared canonical
# source for repositories that install iroha; it is the sharing that is absent
# here, not the design.
.iroha/
